<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata"><apiVersion>68.0</apiVersion><decisions><name>Is_This_an_Upward_Crossing</name><label>Is This an Upward Crossing?</label><description>A score that was already at or above the limit does not start new outreach.</description><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><defaultConnectorLabel>No</defaultConnectorLabel><rules><name>Upward_Crossing</name><conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic><conditions><leftValueReference>forB_IsUpwardCrossing</leftValueReference><operator>EqualTo</operator><rightValue><booleanValue>true</booleanValue></rightValue></conditions><connector><targetReference>Was_the_Student_Alerted_Recently</targetReference></connector><label>Upward Crossing</label></rules></decisions><decisions><name>Was_the_Student_Alerted_Recently</name><label>Was the Student Alerted Recently?</label><description>At most one outreach per cooldown window (7 days).</description><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><defaultConnectorLabel>Alerted Recently</defaultConnectorLabel><rules><name>Outside_Cooldown</name><conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic><conditions><leftValueReference>forB_IsOutsideCooldown</leftValueReference><operator>EqualTo</operator><rightValue><booleanValue>true</booleanValue></rightValue></conditions><connector><targetReference>Update_Last_Alerted_Date</targetReference></connector><label>Outside Cooldown</label></rules></decisions><description>Starts outreach once when a first-year student's risk score crosses the alert limit (SCA-13). Entry: only when the score went up. Then an upward crossing (before below the limit, now at or above it, both from Risk Score Setting Default) outside the cooldown (no alert in the last Alert Cooldown Days, 7) runs the outreach steps and stamps Risk Last Alerted Date. A score that stays above the limit, or crosses again inside the cooldown, starts nothing. Fault path logs a Failed outreach row. Update Message: v1 first version (SCA-13).</description><environments>Default</environments><formulas><name>forB_IsUpwardCrossing</name><dataType>Boolean</dataType><description>True when the score was below the alert limit before this save and is at or above it now.</description><expression>AND(BLANKVALUE({!$Record__Prior.Risk_Score__c}, 0) &lt; {!Get_Risk_Score_Setting.Alert_Limit__c}, {!$Record.Risk_Score__c} &gt;= {!Get_Risk_Score_Setting.Alert_Limit__c})</expression></formulas><formulas><name>forB_IsOutsideCooldown</name><dataType>Boolean</dataType><description>True when the student has not been alerted within the cooldown window.</description><expression>OR(ISBLANK({!$Record.Risk_Last_Alerted_Date__c}), {!$Flow.CurrentDate} - {!$Record.Risk_Last_Alerted_Date__c} &gt;= {!Get_Risk_Score_Setting.Alert_Cooldown_Days__c})</expression></formulas><formulas><name>forT_FailureReason</name><dataType>String</dataType><description>Failure text for the fault path.</description><expression>LEFT("Risk crossing outreach did not complete: " &amp; {!$Flow.FaultMessage}, 255)</expression></formulas><interviewLabel>RT – Contact – Risk Crossing {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel><label>RT – Contact – Risk Crossing</label><processMetadataValues><name>BuilderType</name><value><stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue></value></processMetadataValues><processMetadataValues><name>CanvasMode</name><value><stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue></value></processMetadataValues><processType>AutoLaunchedFlow</processType><recordCreates><name>Create_Failed_Outreach_Log</name><label>Create Failed Outreach Log</label><description>Fault path: logs the failure on the outreach log (SCA-37) instead of failing the nightly scoring run.</description><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><inputAssignments><field>Student__c</field><value><elementReference>$Record.Id</elementReference></value></inputAssignments><inputAssignments><field>Recipient_Type__c</field><value><stringValue>Student</stringValue></value></inputAssignments><inputAssignments><field>Exception_Used__c</field><value><stringValue>None</stringValue></value></inputAssignments><inputAssignments><field>Status__c</field><value><stringValue>Failed</stringValue></value></inputAssignments><inputAssignments><field>Trigger_Score__c</field><value><elementReference>$Record.Risk_Score__c</elementReference></value></inputAssignments><inputAssignments><field>Sent_At__c</field><value><elementReference>$Flow.CurrentDateTime</elementReference></value></inputAssignments><inputAssignments><field>Failure_Reason__c</field><value><elementReference>forT_FailureReason</elementReference></value></inputAssignments><object>Student_Outreach__c</object><storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically></recordCreates><recordLookups><name>Get_Risk_Score_Setting</name><label>Get Risk Score Setting</label><description>Alert limit and cooldown days (SCA-10).</description><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound><connector><targetReference>Is_This_an_Upward_Crossing</targetReference></connector><filterLogic>and</filterLogic><filters><field>DeveloperName</field><operator>EqualTo</operator><value><stringValue>Default</stringValue></value></filters><getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly><object>Risk_Score_Setting__mdt</object><storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically></recordLookups><recordUpdates><name>Update_Last_Alerted_Date</name><label>Update Last Alerted Date</label><description>Stamps today so the cooldown stops repeat outreach. Does not change the score, so the flow does not re-enter.</description><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><faultConnector><targetReference>Create_Failed_Outreach_Log</targetReference></faultConnector><inputAssignments><field>Risk_Last_Alerted_Date__c</field><value><elementReference>$Flow.CurrentDate</elementReference></value></inputAssignments><inputReference>$Record</inputReference></recordUpdates><runInMode>SystemModeWithoutSharing</runInMode><start><locationX>0</locationX><locationY>0</locationY><connector><targetReference>Get_Risk_Score_Setting</targetReference></connector><filterFormula>{!$Record.Risk_Score__c} &gt; BLANKVALUE({!$Record__Prior.Risk_Score__c}, 0)</filterFormula><object>Contact</object><recordTriggerType>Update</recordTriggerType><triggerType>RecordAfterSave</triggerType></start><status>Active</status></Flow>
